    [14300332] = {
        id = 14300332,
        text = "1. You can put in items in the Club Wish Castle to add EXP and upgrade the Wish Castle.\n2. Upgraded Wish Castle provides various buffs to Club members. \n3. Club members could invest Anniversary materials x1 or Infinity Gem x10 to upgrade the castle.\n4. Wish Castle can only get a limited number of EXP per day, it can upgrade by 1 level on day 1 of the event and 2 levels on day 2. A Wish Castle can reach the highest level in 14 days. \n5. Do not worry if you didn't participate in time. The level cap of a Wish Castle is only related to the event open day. Latecomers can directly upgrade their Castle to a level on par with other Clubs. \n6. Covenanters will also get a little surprise when they put in the materials. \n7. Each player can submit a limited number of materials per day and the quota is reset on the next day. Items put in after Club EXP reaches its limit won't add EXP but will still be counted for individual rewards.",
