        text = "How to make Zongzi: \nrecipes for 3 types of Zongzi are listed\nSticky Rice+Corn+Peanut=Cereal Zongzi\n Sticky Rice+Meat+Egg=Meat Zongzi\n Sticky Rice+Bean Paste+Red Date=Bean Zongzi\n\nWhere to get the ingredients: \nSticky Rice Drops in Main/Theater - Normal \nCorn: Drops in Main/Theater - Difficult, Main - Hell. \nPeanut: Drops in Main/Theater - Difficult, Main - Hell. \nMeat: Drops in Main/Theater - Difficult, Main - Hell. \nEgg: Drops in Daily Date. \nBean Paste: Drops in Daily Date. \nRed Date: Drops in Daily Date.",
