    [63049] = {
        id = 63049,
        text = "Mid-autumn Fest Event Guide: \nAnother festival for foodies! The [Autumn Night] event has 4 parts: \n\n1. Collect Food Ingredient \nYou can collect festival food ingredients in any corner of the game. Check event drops info for details. \n\n2. Make Mooncakes\nCollect enough food ingredient to make a mooncake. There are three types of mooncakes: Bean Mooncake, Snow Mooncake and Nuts Mooncake \n\n3. Submit Mooncakes\nCompleting quests by submitting mooncakes to unlock Mid-autumn Fest exclusive dates and CGs. \n\n4. Exchange Mooncakes\nf you have spare mooncakes, exchange them for rewards like exclusive avatars, avatar frames and badges that are only available in this event.",
