    [63051] = {
        id = 63051,
        text = "There are 2 types of training cards: Month Card and Week Card. Upon the purchase, you will become a trainer instantly. \nYou can make Tohka AI better in various ways: fixes issues in Bug Screen, Dislike wrong answers and participate in Training Lab. Active users will be listed on the Spirit AI Ranking and win exclusive avatar frame and exclusive title. \nTraining cards expire 1 week/month since purchase and you can keep training then or update training ranking and trainer info before you renew it. \nYou can renew cards to continue your training.",
