    [63683] = {
        id = 63683,
        text = "1. During the event, if the player level is ≥30 and offline for more than 14 days, the return will trigger the callback event;\n2. The player can unlock the Natsumi Costume-Stardom Chaser by getting 450 points;\n3. How to get points? \na. The returning player can get 15 points per task of the callback event. \nb. Resident players can get 50 points every time they invite returning players to fill in their invitation codes. At the same time, the returning player will provide 5 points to the bound resident player after completing each task. \nc. Players can get 15 points for signing in every day. \n5. Points cannot be found in bag and will be cleared automatically after the event;\n6. If the resident players switch to returning players during the event, the points will be cleared. \n7. Costume which has not been claimed will be distributed by in-game mail.",
        minipack = 0,
