    [14300256] = {
        id = 14300256,
        text = "Along with new spring comes joy... and social practice class! Spirits need to complete their social practice in one month to get rewarded in accordance with their performance. \n\n1. During New Spring Practice Class, you can send Spirits to any practice class, each with different rewards. \n\n2. Each spirit has a practice class for her strong suit and can get 4% extra rewards from that class. \n\n3. Spirits can level up in New Spring Practice Class, after which she'll earn more rewards from classes. \n\n4. Spirits may trigger special incidents during the class and get extra rewards. But each Spirit can only encounter one special incident per day. \n\n5. As time goes by, the rewards of some Practice Class will change: \n\n2021.2.5 – 2021.3.13: Gold, Practice Note, New Spring Bless Coin. \n\n2021.2.14 – 2021.3.1: Fireworks Coin, Luminous Agents, Red Paper. \n\n2021.3.1 - end of event: Lantern Fest Coin, Berry Sugar, Sticky Rice Flour. \n\n6. The output of each practice incident has a cap. The output of spirits in an incident will be temporarily stored and needs to be claimed manually. After the storage cap is reached, spirits will no longer produce items. Remember to collect rewards daily ~\n\n7. The final output is Basic Output x (Spirit level bonus + Incident bonus + Spirit adept bonus) calculated by rounding. \n\n8. Two Practice Classes will enjoy Buff every day with 10% extra output, buff incident changes at 12:30 every day",
        minipack = 0,
    },
