    [15010163] = {
        id = 15010163,
        text = "1. Covenanters can buy Kurumi's Floral Bride costume and rerun costumes and Astral Dresses in the Anniversary Clothes Store. \n2. The Costume House uses 3 types of currency: Park Tokens, Rainbow Quartz and Advanced Costume Fragments. Each is used to purchase different costumes and Astral Dresses. \n3. Each day the Costume House will have a total of 4 Costumes or Astral Dresses available for purchase. You can also get 1 free refresh per day, which increases along with Wish Castle level.\n4. You may use Diamonds to refresh what's currently available in the Costume House.\n5. Up to 10 paid refreshes are allowed per day. The cost goes up with each refresh. \n6. Items that Covenanters already own will not appear in the Costume House. \n7. Rerun Costume & Astral Dress offerings: \n[Cute Maid] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Star of the Party] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Dominator] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Party Invite] Price: Park Token*2000\n[White Sparrow] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Robin Fan] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Christmas Gift] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Treat? Trick!] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Trainee Maid] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Gothic Lolita] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Wondrous Dream] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Formal Apparel for Junior High] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Candy Queen] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Exclusive Maid] Price: Park Token*2000\n[White Bunny] Price: Park Token*2000\n[First Snow] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Spring Song] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Radiant Dawn] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Pure White] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Divine Raiment] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Stardom Chaser] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Bunny Girl] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Starry Night] Price: Park Token*2000\n[Abyssal Stare] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Party Sweetheart] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[End of the World] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Winter Elf] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[True Red Awakening] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Maid Commander] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Moon and Flower] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Dawning Star] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Candlelit Christmas Eve] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Spring Boon] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Dive Into Reality] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Auspicious Lion] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Pine and Moon] Price: Adv. Costume Fragment*50\n[Clumsy Cook] Price: Adv. Costume Fragment*50\n[Maple Prayer] Price: Adv. Costume Fragment*50\n[Abyss Diva] Price: Adv. Costume Fragment*50\n[Cherry Ballad] Price: Adv. Costume Fragment*50\n[Lucky Queen] Price: Adv. Costume Fragment*50\n[Astral Dress - Clumsy Cook] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Abyss Dominator] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Black Raven] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Astral Dress - Butterfly Dreams] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Halloween Witch] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Oriental Wind] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Astral Dress - Winter Elf] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Time Magician] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Astral Dress - Commander] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Dawning Star] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Lotus Witch] Price: Rainbow Quartz*168\n[Astral Dress - Christmas Eve Witch] Price: Rainbow Quartz*128\n[Astral Dress - Candy Queen] Price: Rainbow Quartz*68",
